---
layout: base.njk
title: Correspondence
description: "Contact A-XS for private dossiers, technical consulting, collaborations, and interface work. Direct correspondence through GitHub."
permalink: /contact/
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="page-hero__meta">
      <span>Plate / V</span>
      <span>Correspondence</span>
      <span>Direct / No funnel</span>
    </div>
    <div class="page-hero__grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
        <h1>Start a <em>conversation.</em></h1>
      </div>
      <aside class="page-hero__aside">
        <div><strong>Channel</strong>GitHub</div>
        <div><strong>For</strong>Dossiers · collaboration · consulting</div>
        <div><strong>Replies</strong>Considered, not automated</div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <p class="page-hero__lede">
      For private dossiers, technical consulting, or a collaboration with a hard edge.
      Include the context and the question you need answered.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="contact-rows">
      <a class="contact-row" href="{{ site.github }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">
        <span class="contact-row__label">GitHub</span>
        <span class="contact-row__value">{{ site.githubHandle }} <span class="contact-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
      {% if site.linkedin %}
        <a class="contact-row" href="{{ site.linkedin }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">
          <span class="contact-row__label">LinkedIn</span>
          <span class="contact-row__value">{{ site.linkedinHandle }} <span class="contact-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>
      {% endif %}
      <a class="contact-row" href="{{ site.repo }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
        <span class="contact-row__label">Site source</span>
        <span class="contact-row__value">axs-official.github.io <span class="contact-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="shell split">
    <aside class="split__aside">
      <span class="eyebrow">I / The message</span>
      <h2>What to include.</h2>
      <p class="mono-label">Precision is a courtesy.</p>
    </aside>
    <div class="split__body">
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step" data-reveal>
          <span class="step__num">01</span>
          <h3>Who you are.</h3>
          <p>
            Your name, your role, and the context you are writing from. A link to the
            work you are building is useful.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal>
          <span class="step__num">02</span>
          <h3>What you are building.</h3>
          <p>
            The problem, the stage, and the constraint that makes it interesting. A
            paragraph is enough; a deck is not required.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal>
          <span class="step__num">03</span>
          <h3>What you need.</h3>
          <p>
            A dossier, a technical review, a collaboration, or a specific question. The
            clearer the ask, the more useful the reply.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal>
          <span class="step__num">04</span>
          <h3>What happens next.</h3>
          <p>
            If the work aligns, you will get a direct reply and, where appropriate, a
            private dossier under confidence. If it does not, you will be told plainly.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="access-panel" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">II / Direct</span>
        <h2>The archive is one message away.</h2>
        <p>
          A-XS is open to focused collaborations: language and tooling design, native
          Windows software, interface systems, and technical art direction. The archive
          is private; the conversation is not.
        </p>
        <div class="access-panel__actions">
          <a class="button button--accent" href="{{ site.github }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Open GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="button" href="/archive/">Read about the archive <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="access-panel__seal">
        {% inlineSvg "assets/img/seal.svg" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="mono-label">No newsletter. No CRM. No tracking. The correspondence is the product.</p>
  </div>
</section>
